  <property name="whatsThis"><string>Which corner of the skin each touch sensor sits in. Activities light the LED-strip pixels above the sensor that was touched, so this is what makes a touch on the top-left corner light the top-left arc. Only a four-sensor magnet board has corner quadrants; other layouts space the sensors evenly.</string></property>
